Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:01.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}You don't need a new year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.72,0:00:03.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}to start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.04,0:00:05.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}You need a softer Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:08.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Here are five small soft-life habits
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.64,0:00:09.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}that don't look like much on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.92,0:00:10.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}day one,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.60,0:00:12.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}but quietly change how your whole
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.84,0:00:14.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}year feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.84,0:00:15.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Number one:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:17.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}protect your first ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.73,0:00:19.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Before the phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.17,0:00:20.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}before the news,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.17,0:00:22.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}before everyone else's opinions,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.45,0:00:24.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}give yourself ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.57,0:00:26.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Open the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.17,0:00:28.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Drink some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.13,0:00:29.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Stretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.33,0:00:31.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Let the day start with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.09,0:00:33.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}not with your notifications.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.37,0:00:34.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Number two:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.93,0:00:37.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}eat one meal a day slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.17,0:00:38.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Not at your desk,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.41,0:00:39.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}not while scrolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.01,0:00:41.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Just you and your food.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.93,0:00:43.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}It sounds small,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.29,0:00:44.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}but it reminds your body that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.93,0:00:47.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}you are allowed to slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:48.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Number three:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.77,0:00:49.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}tidy one corner,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.93,0:00:51.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}not the whole house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.41,0:00:53.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Waiting for the energy to clean
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.29,0:00:56.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}everything is how nothing gets clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.13,0:00:57.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Pick your nightstand,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.41,0:00:58.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}your desk,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.13,0:00:59.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}or one shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.49,0:01:01.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}A calm corner gives your mind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.37,0:01:03.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}a place to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.57,0:01:04.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Number four:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.67,0:01:07.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}say no without a long explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.27,0:01:08.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}"I can't make it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.39,0:01:10.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}but thank you for inviting me."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.43,0:01:12.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}That's a complete sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.51,0:01:14.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}You don't owe everyone a reason
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.39,0:01:16.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}for protecting your time and your
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.55,0:01:18.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.11,0:01:19.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Number five:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.13,0:01:20.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}end the day with a done
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.59,0:01:21.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}list.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.32,0:01:23.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Instead of staring at everything you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.48,0:01:24.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}didn't finish,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.52,0:01:26.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}write down three things you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.92,0:01:28.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Replied to that message.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.96,0:01:30.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Went for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.68,0:01:32.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Made dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.04,0:01:34.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Your mind notices progress when you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.40,0:01:36.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}show it progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.44,0:01:38.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}None of these habits are dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.99,0:01:40.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}That's the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.75,0:01:42.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}A soft life isn't one big
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.91,0:01:43.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}makeover.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.83,0:01:45.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}It's a hundred small choices that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.87,0:01:46.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}say:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.27,0:01:48.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}I matter too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.43,0:01:50.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}So here's my question for you:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.67,0:01:52.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}which one will you try this
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.15,0:01:52.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}week?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.99,0:01:54.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Tell me in the comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.65,0:01:56.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}And come back on Wednesday,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.73,0:01:58.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}because we're talking about how to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.41,0:02:00.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}stop comparing your life to everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.57,0:02:02.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}online.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.25,0:02:04.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Subscribe for a new talk every
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.29,0:02:06.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Wednesday and Sunday.
